{"id":230,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Scales shed by this Pokémon have such a splendorous gleam to them that they’ve been given to royalty as gifts."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"With the arrival of a storm at sea, this Pokémon will show itself on the surface. When a Kingdra and a Dragonite meet, a fierce battle ensues."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Kingdra sleeps on the seafloor where it is otherwise devoid of life. When a storm arrives, the Pokémon is said to awaken and wander about in search of prey."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Kingdra lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this Pokémon creates spiraling ocean currents."},{"games":["Y","Crystal"],"text":"It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life-forms can survive."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves."},{"games":["SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor. When it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Swift Swim","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in rain."},{"name":"Sniper","hidden":false,"description":"If the Pokémon's attack lands a critical hit, the attack is powered up even further."},{"name":"Damp","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon dampens its surroundings, preventing all Pokémon from using explosive moves such as Self-Destruct."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"m